  "scope": {
    "summary": "A parallel split into four branches and a join — four work items open on one instance at once.",
    "measures": [
      "the parallel split's fan-out and the join's local token counting",
      "concurrent completions on a single instance serializing on its row lock — four workers can claim this instance's branches simultaneously and exactly one of them fires the join",
      "the merge-patch path under concurrency: four branch completions patching one variable document without clobbering each other"
    ],
